# Sneak Past Sentinel lives on the hosted service (Railway). These rules show
# it on this domain: /play is the short link, and the two proxy rewrites (200)
# serve the page and pass its /sneak/api calls (POST bodies and the player's
# Authorization header included) through to Railway. They must stay above the
# SPA fallback, because Netlify uses the first rule that matches.
/play         /sneak                                                        301
/sneak        https://sentinel-production-89e8.up.railway.app/sneak         200
/sneak/*      https://sentinel-production-89e8.up.railway.app/sneak/:splat  200

# SPA fallback: everything else, /replay included, is the React app.
/*            /index.html                                                   200
